<title>NEW ZEALAND: DB Group first half result due June 11.</title>
<headline>DB Group first half result due June 11.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brewer DB Group Ltd said on Wednesday it would release its first half result on June 11.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
